# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value. .env.local is not committed.
#
# Contact form destination. Create a form at https://formspree.io, then paste its address here.
# It looks like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz. This is a public address, not a secret.
# On Vercel, add the same name and value under Project Settings > Environment Variables.
# Without it, the contact form shows a "not connected yet" message and sends nothing.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
